  "title": "Red River Bancshares, Inc. Announces Increase to Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "ALEXANDRIA, La., Feb. 26, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Red River Bancshares, Inc. (Nasdaq: RRBI) (the “Company”) announced today that on February 26, 2026, its board of directors declared a quarterly cash dividend in an amount equal to $0.25 per share of common stock, up $0.10, or approximately 67%,",
